@startuml
!theme plain
actor Planner
participant "Pareto tab\nParetoViewComponent" as UI
participant "ParetoController\n/api/v1/solutions" as API
participant "ParetoService" as SVC
participant "RouteComplianceService" as LEZ
database "MySQL" as DB

title D05 S-3 Compare and apply a Pareto alternative

Planner -> UI: open the Pareto tab
UI -> API: GET /solutions/{id}/pareto
API -> SVC: getFrontier(id, branchId)
SVC -> DB: solution (branch-scoped) -> job -> pareto_candidates
alt foreign or unknown solution
  SVC --> API: 400 + 0040402
else own solution
  SVC --> API: ParetoFrontierDTO: candidates with weights, totals,\nfrontier_status, engine_selected, applicable
end
API --> UI: chart from the returned metrics (no recomputation)

Planner -> UI: apply candidate K
UI -> API: POST /solutions/{id}/pareto/{cid}/apply
API -> SVC: apply(id, cid, branchId)
alt candidate not of this job / branch
  SVC --> API: 400 + 0040402
else base is not the latest revision
  SVC --> API: 409 + latest revision id
else candidate already active on the base
  SVC --> API: 200 base solution, nothing saved
else not FRONTIER or different order set
  SVC --> API: 422
else applicable
  SVC -> DB: insert PARETO_ALTERNATIVE child of base,\nroutes, stops
  SVC -> LEZ: certify the new routes with the current rules
  SVC --> API: 200 SolutionDetailResponseDTO
end
API --> UI: new active solution
@enduml
